  <!-- EN: An unroofed ritual spot at night. Spot must be unroofed with at least 25 unroofed cells in the area. -->
  <VME_RitualTargetDivineTheStarsInfo>一个无屋顶遮挡且处于晚上的仪式点。场地附近需要有至少25格无屋顶的空间。</VME_RitualTargetDivineTheStarsInfo>
  <!-- EN: A built wicker man. -->
  <VME_WickerManInfo>一个已建造的柳条人。</VME_WickerManInfo>
  <!-- EN: You need a prisoner to start the wicker man ritual. -->
  <VME_CantStartWickerManRitual>你需要一名囚犯来开始柳条人火刑仪式。</VME_CantStartWickerManRitual>
  <!-- EN: Participant must be a slave. -->
  <VME_MessageRitualRoleMustBeSlave>参与者必须是一名奴隶。</VME_MessageRitualRoleMustBeSlave>
  <!-- EN: Organizer and participants must be consenting adults. -->
  <VME_NeedsAdults>组织者和参与者必须都是成年人。</VME_NeedsAdults>
  <!-- EN: No reachable wicker man. -->
  <VME_AbilityDisabledNoWickerMan>没有可达的柳条人。</VME_AbilityDisabledNoWickerMan>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target a turret or mechanoid. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsATurret>此技能必须以炮塔或机械族作为目标。</VME_AbilityNeedsATurret>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target a wild or hostile insectoid. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsInsect>此技能必须以野生或敌对的虫族作为目标。</VME_AbilityNeedsInsect>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target an empty spot under mountain roof. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsRoof>目标点位必须处在山岩顶下。</VME_AbilityNeedsRoof>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target an empty spot. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsSpotEmpty>目标点位不能有其他物品阻挡。</VME_AbilityNeedsSpotEmpty>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target food categorized as a meal. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsMeal>此技能必须以食物作为目标。</VME_AbilityNeedsMeal>
  <!-- EN: A trader caravan has been attracted to your settlement and will arrive in approximately a day. -->
  <VME_AbilityCaravanWillArrive>一支贸易商队将在大约1天后抵达。</VME_AbilityCaravanWillArrive>
  <!-- EN: Meal is already a dessert. This ability needs to target a meal that isn't a dessert. -->
  <VME_AbilityAlreadyADessert>目标食物已经是甜点了。</VME_AbilityAlreadyADessert>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target a free colonist. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsAColonist>此技能必须以不受限制的殖民者作为目标。</VME_AbilityNeedsAColonist>
  <!-- EN: This ability needs to target a fresh humanoid corpse. -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsCorpse>此技能必须以新鲜的人类尸体作为目标。</VME_AbilityNeedsCorpse>
  <!-- EN: {0}'s ideo lacks the Organ use: post mortem precept. Ability can't be used without it -->
  <VME_AbilityNeedsOrganPostMortemPrecept>{0}的文化缺少“使用器官：死后收割”戒律。无法在没有此戒律的情况下施展能力。</VME_AbilityNeedsOrganPostMortemPrecept>
  <!-- EN: Uninstall building -->
  <VME_DeconstructBuildingLabel>卸载</VME_DeconstructBuildingLabel>
  <!-- EN: Uninstall junk building to be able to move and reintall it. These can be caravaned out of a map, making "junk expeditions" possible -->
  <VME_DeconstructBuildingDesc>卸载并打包这个远古残骸，以便移动或安装在其他地方。远古残骸能通过远行队来运输，这也使得四处“捡垃圾”成为了可能。</VME_DeconstructBuildingDesc>
  <!-- EN: Cancel uninstall building -->
  <VME_CancelDeconstructBuildingLabel>取消</VME_CancelDeconstructBuildingLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cancel uninstall building -->
  <VME_CancelDeconstructBuildingDesc>取消</VME_CancelDeconstructBuildingDesc>
  <!-- EN: Last straw: cosmic horror -->
  <VME_BreakCorruption>压倒骆驼的最后一根稻草：来自宇宙的恐怖</VME_BreakCorruption>
  <!-- EN: Must be built on passable water. -->
  <VME_NeedsWater>必须建造在可通过的水面上。</VME_NeedsWater>
  <!-- EN: Fish traps must be built at least 10 tiles apart from each other. -->
  <VME_NeedsDistance>渔网之间至少要相隔10格距离。</VME_NeedsDistance>
  <!-- EN: This fish trap can catch small fish: -->
  <VME_SmallFishTrapDescriptionInspect>此渔网能够捕获小型鱼：</VME_SmallFishTrapDescriptionInspect>
  <!-- EN: Next small fish caught in -->
  <VME_SmallFishCaughtIn>距捕获下一批小型鱼还剩：</VME_SmallFishCaughtIn>
