  <VME_MediumFishTrapDescriptionInspect>此渔网能够捕获中型鱼：</VME_MediumFishTrapDescriptionInspect>
  <!-- EN: Next medium fish caught in -->
  <VME_MediumFishCaughtIn>距捕获下一批中型鱼还剩：</VME_MediumFishCaughtIn>
  <!-- EN: This fish trap can catch large fish: -->
  <VME_LargeFishTrapDescriptionInspect>此渔网能够捕获大型鱼：</VME_LargeFishTrapDescriptionInspect>
  <!-- EN: Next large fish caught in -->
  <VME_LargeFishCaughtIn>距捕获下一批大型鱼还剩：</VME_LargeFishCaughtIn>
  <!-- EN: Catches until breaking: {0} -->
  <VME_UsesLeftUntilItBreaks>捕获{0}次后损坏</VME_UsesLeftUntilItBreaks>
  <!-- EN: Only adults can participate in this ritual -->
  <VME_PawnMustBeAnAdult>只有成年人才能参加这个仪式</VME_PawnMustBeAnAdult>
  <!-- EN: Insect nest maintenance: {0}% -->
  <VME_Maintenance>虫巢维护值：{0}%</VME_Maintenance>
  <!-- EN: Maintenance needed. If it reaches 0% the nest will be destroyed. -->
  <VME_MaintenanceNeeded>需要维护。如果维护值降至0%，虫巢将会损坏。</VME_MaintenanceNeeded>
  <!-- EN: The Queen snorts at you: "No, I don't think I will" -->
  <VME_NotTheQueen>虫后对你嗤之以鼻：“不，我想我不愿意。”</VME_NotTheQueen>
  <!-- EN: Could not find any valid party spot or organizer was unavailable. -->
  <VME_NoValidPartySpot>找不到任何有效的聚会举办点或组织者不可用。</VME_NoValidPartySpot>
  <!-- EN: You need a reasonably healthy prisoner to start the ritual -->
  <VME_CantStartRitualNoConvertee>你需要一名健康的囚犯来开始仪式</VME_CantStartRitualNoConvertee>
  <!-- EN: Unfortunately, {0} refused to see our reasonable ways and was sacrificed. -->
  <VME_ViolentOutcome>不幸的是，{0}拒绝接受我们合理正确的行为准则，最终成为了牺牲品。</VME_ViolentOutcome>
  <!-- EN: {0} saw our reasonable ways and was converted to our ideoligion. -->
  <VME_NonViolentOutcome>{0}接受了我们合理正确的行为准则，最终皈依了我们的文化。</VME_NonViolentOutcome>
  <!-- EN: Ritual needs to be done at night, or under any condition that lowers light below 50% globally (eclipses don't count). -->
  <VME_RitualNeedsNightOrDarkness>仪式需要在夜晚进行，或者在全局亮度降至50%以下时进行（日蚀不包括在内）。</VME_RitualNeedsNightOrDarkness>
  <!-- EN: Ritual needs to be done at night, and with clear weather. -->
  <VME_RitualNeedsClearWeather>仪式需要在天气晴朗的夜晚进行。</VME_RitualNeedsClearWeather>
  <!-- EN: Bonfire at {0}% strength -->
  <VME_BonfireDyingIn>篝火的强度：{0}%</VME_BonfireDyingIn>
  <!-- EN: High corruption -->
  <VEM_HighCorruption>堕落值过高</VEM_HighCorruption>
  <!-- EN: These people have a too high corruption need (more than 90%). If they reach 100% corruption they will get an extreme level mental break:\n\n{0} -->
  <VEM_HighCorruptionDesc>这些人的堕落需求已经过高（超过90%）。如果堕落值达到100%，他们将立即陷入极高等级的精神崩溃状态：\n\n{0}</VEM_HighCorruptionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Low corruption -->
  <VEM_LowCorruption>堕落值过低</VEM_LowCorruption>
  <!-- EN: These people have a too low corruption need (less than 10%). If they reach 0% corruption they will be easily swayed to a different ideoligion. Build obelisks to maintain their corruption need or perform Incantation rituals to increase it by 10%:\n\n{0} -->
  <VEM_LowCorruptionDesc>这些人的堕落需求已经过低（少于10%）。如果堕落值达到0%，他们将很容易被其他文化所动摇。可通过建造不详方尖碑来阻止堕落值降低，或通过举行诅咒仪式来增加10%的堕落值：\n\n{0}</VEM_LowCorruptionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Chunks of ancient space junk have impacted nearby. You can uninstall and move them to build your junkyard.\n\nThis event happens if you have any colonists with an ideo using the Scrapper meme. -->
  <VME_MessageJunkChunkDrop>几块远古飞船碎片从太空掉落至附近。你可以通过卸载并移动它们来建造更大型的残骸场。\n\n此事件只会在拥有“节俭主义”模因时出现。</VME_MessageJunkChunkDrop>
  <!-- EN: Colonist must be capable of Talking -->
  <VME_MessageRitualRoleMustBeCapableOfSocial>殖民者必须要有说话的能力</VME_MessageRitualRoleMustBeCapableOfSocial>
  <!-- EN: Ritual needs the Exalted Priesthood meme -->
  <VME_NeedsExaltedPriesthood>该仪式需要崇高圣职的模因</VME_NeedsExaltedPriesthood>
  <!-- EN: Heir changed -->
  <VME_HeirChange>继承人变更</VME_HeirChange>
  <!-- EN: Due to royal inheritance, {1} has been automatically designated as the heir of {0} -->
  <VME_HeirChangeDesc>根据“荣誉头衔：继承”戒律，{1}已自动被指定为{0}的荣誉头衔继承人。</VME_HeirChangeDesc>
  <!-- EN: 200 silver needs to be found in stockpiles near a trading beacon for the fair to bot be considered "cheap" -->
  <VME_CheapTradingFair>至少需要放置200白银在轨道交易信标附近，否则会被认定为“敷衍的贸易展会”</VME_CheapTradingFair>
